          "content": "2026-10-06 · The Studio catches up with the code of 2026-10-03 to 10-05. Shell, on the 23 drawn screens: the one-pill scene bar gives way to the look bar (camera menu, Cerrado · Abierto · Armado as icons), «Editar: Exterior · Interior» at the right and the measures switch at the bottom right (UI-67, UI-75); the Mueble tab leaves the 17 tab rows that had it (UI-72, UI-74); the header's second line carries the ficha's code or «Personalizado». The sideboard is the base «Aparador con patas» (KC-APA-01 v5) with its real first message and the ideas of its kind; the drawn desktop screens name a real expert in the header, because without one the composer is not there; the review intro is the connected one. The Furniture column (16 screens of the Mueble tab: plan sheet, cabinet sheet, locks, joints, quick adjust) is deleted and replaced by an Edit column of captures, 12 mobile and 8 desktop; new captures for the scene open and taken apart, the chat without an expert, the review gate without an expert, «Se puede hacer» and the rest of Ajustes; 15 older captures retaken. Six captures stay stale (old shell), listed in the mobile 2 brief. Not redone: the 3D images under the drawn screens are the ones of 2026-10-02 · UI-67 to UI-78",
