          "content": "2026-10-02 · kit 0.4.0 · re-vendored: focus and on-rust tokens, rust and paper values, 44 px buttons, Button/Disabled in place of the dimmed instances (Aplicar now carries the check, UI-36), RadioCard, FinishSelect and TraceLog added; Thinking pill without \"Cancelar\" and sized to its content; proposal buttons read \"Aplicar así\" for a critical proposal; the proposal chip carries \"Ver propuesta\" and the resolved chip a close · UI-36, UI-40, UI-45, UI-46, UI-47, UI-51, UI-56. Not redrawn: the 30 captures of the real app (retake them), the new states, the legs row",
